482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UC}\">\\(\\operatorname{UC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in V_N\">\\(n\\in V_N\\)</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 在每个实例中选为新的集合变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Delta1\\text{-}CA}\\vdash\\;\\Delta^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{UC}\\left(\\forall n(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\to\\exists X\\forall n(n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)\\right):\n\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2),\\ \\psi\\in\\Pi^0_1(S_2),\\ X\\in V_S,\\ X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\psi)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Delta1\\text{-}CA}\\vdash\\;\\Delta^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{UC}\\left(\\forall n(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\to\\exists X\\forall n(n\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)\\right):\n\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2),\\ \\psi\\in\\Pi^0_1(S_2),\\ X\\in V_S,\\ X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\psi)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个实例保留两种描述等价的前件。不能改写成对两个前束语法类字面交集的理解；也不能无条件形成所有 Σ⁰₁ 定义的集合。两公式共有的自由参数由外层 UC 统一绑定。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions I.7.3, II.1.4；纸面页 24, 25, 64；PDF 页 42, 43, 82。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved"